<view class="page bottom-space"
  ><view class="eyebrow">MILEAGE / 月度里程</view
  ><view class="title">记录走过的路。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取里程信息…</view
  ><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty"
    ><view>{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="reload">重新加载</button
    ><button class="text-button" bindtap="openUse">返回用车</button></view
  ><view wx:elif="{{submitted}}" class="card"
    ><view class="tag">待审核</view><view class="section-title">里程复核记录已保存</view
    ><view class="muted">本次录入不代表后台已审核，也不会自动生成费用。</view
    ><button class="primary" bindtap="openRecord">查看记录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="returnToPeriods">查看月台账与其他月份</button></view
  ><view wx:elif="{{!subscription}}" class="empty"
    ><view class="section-title">暂无可复核里程的订阅</view
    ><button class="secondary" bindtap="openUse">返回用车</button></view
  ><block wx:else
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="label">{{subscription.vehicleName}} · 订阅月台账</view
      ><view class="price">每订阅月 {{usage.baseAllowanceKm}} 公里</view><view class="muted">从实际交车日起按订阅月计算，基础优先使用、期末清零；里程包余额 {{usage.packBalanceKm}} 公里 · {{usage.packStatusText}}</view></view
    ><view class="card"><view class="section-title">选择需要申报或补证的订阅月</view><view wx:if="{{!usage.periods.length}}" class="muted">尚无可读取月份，请联系运营核对实际交车日期。</view><radio-group bindchange="selectUsagePeriod"><label wx:for="{{usage.periods}}" wx:key="id" class="attachment-row"><radio value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{periodId === item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !item.canSubmit}}" color="#B44919"/><view><view>第 {{item.sequence}} 月 · {{item.periodText}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.statusText}} · 月界/归还日 {{item.boundaryDateText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.reviewNote}}" class="notice">{{item.reviewNote}}</view></view></label></radio-group></view
    ><view class="notice"
      >仅申报所选订阅月月界或归还日的实际仪表照片与累计读数。缺报、照片不足须补证，尚未人工审核时不会估算或跨月平均分摊，也不表示费用已结算。</view
    ><block wx:if="{{selectedPeriod}}"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">第 {{selectedPeriod.sequence}} 月 · {{selectedPeriod.periodText}}</view><view class="muted">期初确认读数 {{selectedPeriod.startReadingKm == null ? "待前月结算核对" : selectedPeriod.startReadingKm + " km"}}；请使用 {{selectedPeriod.boundaryDateText}} 实际拍摄的仪表照片。</view><view class="field"><view class="label">照片实际拍摄日期（北京时间）</view><picker mode="date" start="{{selectedPeriod.effectiveEndDate}}" end="{{selectedPeriod.effectiveEndDate}}" value="{{recordedDate}}" bindchange="captureDate" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input">{{recordedDate || '请选择实际拍摄日期'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">照片实际拍摄时间（北京时间）</view><picker mode="time" value="{{recordedTime}}" bindchange="captureTime" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input">{{recordedTime || '请选择实际拍摄时分'}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="card"
      ><view class="field"
        ><view class="label">累计里程（km）</view
        ><input
          class="input reading-input"
          type="number"
          value="{{reading}}"
          maxlength="7"
          placeholder="输入当前读数"
          data-field="reading"
          bindinput="input"
          disabled="{{busy}}" /></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="section-title">仪表盘凭证</view
      ><view class="muted"
        >至少上传 1 张。最多 4 张，每张不超过 10 MB。</view
      ><view wx:for="{{attachments}}" wx:key="index" class="attachment-row"
        ><text>{{item.name}} · 已上传</text
        ><button
          class="text-button"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          bindtap="removeAttachment"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
          >移除</button
        ></view
      ><button
        wx:if="{{attachments.length < 4}}"
        class="secondary"
        bindtap="chooseAttachments"
        loading="{{choosing}}"
        disabled="{{busy || choosing}}"
        >上传仪表凭证</button
      ></view
    ><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !reading || !recordedDate || !recordedTime || !attachments.length}}"
      >提交本订阅月仪表证据</button
    ></block><button class="secondary" bindtap="openUsage">查看月结算、里程包及退订结算</button></block
  ></view
>
